lly<br>
&gt;&gt; &gt; irrelevant. Another protocol that uses this draft may well be=
<br>
&gt;&gt; &gt; vulnerable, and thus this is just leaving a huge security lan=
dmine<br>
&gt;&gt; &gt; in TLS channel bindings.<br>
